{
  "schema": "ld-s10y-image/figure-spec@2",
  "id": "fig-62",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "Identify regions of the overlapping integer set Z and positive-number set P without naming or supplying the requested regions or example elements.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/7a/figures/fig-62.png",
      "sha256": "4f80eb8f3bf66b32cc901da649f567cf577cfbfebec488d6a3b95fbf17ce14b3"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "alg7-c4-ex",
        "exercise": "913",
        "text": "913. 在图$62$里，表示了整数集合$Z$和正数集合$P$之间的关系。a) 图形的哪一部分对应于自然数(正整数)的集合？b) 图形的哪一部分对应于正数但不是整数的集合？c) 图形的哪一部分对应于整数但不是正数的集合？对于a)、b)和c)每一种情形举出集合的几个元素。"
      }
    ],
    "inventory": [
      {
        "id": "overlapping-boundaries",
        "description": "One shared two-set diagram, not two subfigures: near-circular left Z and right P outlines cross twice. Neither contains the other. The outer complement is blank and has no universal-set frame. Circle regularization and equal radii are modern, not measured source values.",
